@startuml STM-6
!include _style.iuml
title STM-6 (System level) — Lifecycle of a FaultEvent (Operator alert)\nfault_events.status · v1.0 · 01/11/2026

[*] -down-> Open
note left of Open
  created by a fault signal on a connector
  with no open fault: Charge Point reports
  Faulted, 2nd Driver report within 2 h,
  or Charge Point offline past the alert
  delay (≤ 900 s)
end note

state "Open" as Open {
  [*] -down-> raised : / hide connector, void\nreservations, alert Operator
  raised -down-> acknowledged : Operator acknowledges
  acknowledged -down-> resetting : Operator sends\nremote reset
  resetting -up-> acknowledged : reset refused\nor after(120 s)
}
Open : fault signal / attach to this fault

Open -right-> resolved : connector reports Available\nor Charge Point back online
acknowledged -right-> resolved : Operator closes\nafter site visit
resolved : entry / show connector, clear label
resolved -down-> [*]
note bottom of Open
  Open groups raised, acknowledged, resetting;
  it is not a status value.
  Maintenance ticket (Should): open → in_progress → closed.
end note
@enduml
